<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 22.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 22.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    96/97    103/104     UNQ     189/190</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   97/98    103/107   190/193   200/205</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker quotes fell $3 to $4 per tonne late Thursday as sellers cut prices to attract buyers, traders said. Independents quoted as low as $100 per tonne for 380-cst, they said. &quot;There are a lot of European shipowners enquiring for bunkers, taking advantage of the price fall,&quot; a trader said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
